<title>USA: Merrill Lynch names Newbigging director.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch names Newbigging director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc said on Monday it has elected David Newbigging to the board of directors for a term that runs until 1998.</p>
<p>Newbigging is chairman of  Equitas Holdings Ltd of the United Kingdom and the retired chairman and senior managing director of Jardine Matheson &amp; Co Ltd, the Hong Kong based trading unit of Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Newbigging's appointment will be an &quot;enormous asset&quot; to the firm because his experience throughout the Asia/Pacific region and the United Kingdom will aid in developing global operations.</p>
</text>
